{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32955","headline":"有赠 一 · 崔珏","name":"有赠 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫道妆成断客肠，粉胸绵手白莲香。\n烟分顶上三层绿，劒截眸中一寸光。\n舞胜柳枝腰更软，歌嫌珠贯曲犹长。\n虽然不似王孙女，解爱临邛卖赋郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔珏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32955.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32955","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗镜》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩鏡_(四庫全書本)）"}